MODULE: CheckpointSkipsPrepare
TARGET: CheckpointHeld
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the durable checkpoint advances over a still-staged prepared entry
PERTURBS: Consume

--- FIND
          /\ staged' = (staged \/ ~abandoned)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<length, installed, value, ckpt, abandoned, historyRetained,
--- REPLACE
          /\ staged' = (staged \/ ~abandoned)
    /\ ckpt' = [ckpt EXCEPT ![p] = read[p]+1]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<length, installed, value, abandoned, historyRetained,
--- END
